## Interface: 11200
## Title: Opulent Casting Bars
## Notes: Highly visual casting bars with per-school magic textures and animations.
## Author: Original addon: SimonPdv; Vanilla 1.12.1 version: Drakensangs
## Version: 1.0
## SavedVariables: OpulentCastingBarsDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: OpulentCastingBarsCharDB
## Dependencies: !!!ClassicAPI

# Localization: English defaults always load; ClassicAPI loads only
# the file that matches the client's locale on top of them.
localization\localization.lua
localization\localization.de.lua    [AllowLoadTextLocale deDE]
localization\localization.es.lua    [AllowLoadTextLocale esES]
localization\localization.fr.lua    [AllowLoadTextLocale frFR]
localization\localization.ko.lua    [AllowLoadTextLocale koKR]
localization\localization.cn.lua    [AllowLoadTextLocale zhCN]
localization\localization.tw.lua    [AllowLoadTextLocale zhTW]

# Namespace, settings and cast events
Core.lua

# Reveal-mask helpers
Compat.lua

# MaskTexture-based progressive reveal for FX overlays
Clip.lua

# Style definitions and spell -> style detection
Schools.lua

# End-of-cast animations (fade, fail shake, flashes)
Animations.lua

# Per-style visual effects
